+· `0031_proposal_load_facility_context.sql` · `documentFingerprint.ts` ·
+`merchantMemoryService.ts` · `documentDedupDisposal.test.ts` (23 tests)
+
+**Changed:** `aiProposal.ts` (form) · `documentExtraction.ts` (mapping) ·
