+# LeaseOS — v20.17 Checkpoint: P3 Integrity Closure
+
+| | Previous | New |
+|---|---|---|
+| Version | v20.16 | **v20.17** |
+| Tables | 140 | **141** |
+| Migrations | 30 | **31** |
+| Procedures (role-authorized) | 152 | **152** |
