+
+| | Previous | New |
+|---|---|---|
+| Version | v20.21 | **v20.22** |
+| Tables | 158 | **164** (+6; `complianceRequirements`, `loads`, `disposalTickets` extended) |
+| Migrations | 35 | **36** |
+| Procedures (role-authorized) | 176 | **182** |
+| Bare `protectedProcedure` | 0 | **0** |
