+# LeaseOS — v20.12.1 Checkpoint: Universal Permissions
+
+| | Previous | New |
+|---|---|---|
+| Version | v20.12 | **v20.12.1** |
+| Tables | 131 | 131 |
+| Migrations | 23 | 23 |
+| Procedures (role-authorized) | 142 | 142 |
