+
+| | v22.0 | **v22.1** |
+|---|---|---|
+| Tables | 249 | **250** (+1; `fieldTicketEvents.billableMinutes`) |
+| Migrations | 57 | **58** |
+| Role-authorized procedures | 353 | **356** (+3 on `closeoutRouter.ts`) |
